els that remained very classic, using only grouped-query attention without =
piling on other efficiency tricks. Sarvam is a particularly useful comparis=
on point as well: the 30B model keeps classic GQA, while the 105B version s=
witches to MLA.</span></p><div class=3D"captioned-image-container"><figure>=
