/button></div></div></h2><p><span>The gated attention block in Qwen-style h=
ybrids or Trinity (not a hybrid) is essentially standard scaled-dot-product=
 attention with a few changes on top. In the original </span><a href=3D"htt=
ps://arxiv.org/abs/2505.06708">Gated Attention paper</a><span>, those chang=
es are presented as a way to make the retained full-attention layers behave=
 more predictably inside a hybrid stack.</span></p><p>The block still looks=
