button></div></div></h2><p>Kimi Linear keeps the same broad transformer ske=
leton and the same 3:1 pattern, but it changes both halves of the recipe.</=
p><p>On the lightweight side, Kimi Delta Attention is a refinement of Gated=
 DeltaNet. Where Qwen3-Next uses a scalar gate per head to control memory d=
ecay, Kimi uses channel-wise gating, which gives finer control over the mem=
ory update. On the heavier side, Kimi replaces Qwen3-Next=E2=80=99s gated-a=
ttention layers with gated MLA layers.</p><p>So, it=E2=80=99s still the sam=
e broader pattern as in Qwen3-Next and Qwen3.5, but both ingredients (sligh=
tly) change. I.e., most layers are still handled by a cheaper linear-style =
mechanism, and periodic heavier layers still remain for stronger retrieval.=
